2026-09-08,mac,appkit,P46,ok,ok,window,unrecorded,"increment-the-state-object: replayed 1 action. First macOS row for P46 -- it could not build here until ObservableObject and Published were qualified with SwiftCrossUI., because Foundation re-exports Combine's on Apple platforms and the names were ambiguous. -hittest confirmed the click landed on the NSButton (rect 539,594 size 128x27 against frame-origin 530,93). After the press: P46Model constructions still 1, model.count 1, observed child sees count 1 -- so the @StateObject contract holds and the @ObservedObject publisher reached the child"
