2026-09-09,windows,gtk4,P34,ok,ok,window,default,"#33 ScrollViewReader DRIVEN for the first time via the new actions/win/P34-scroll-to-row-50.csv. Log: scrollTo row 50 requested, anchor top. Capture: the top visible row goes from Row 0 to Row 50 (screen-20260909-095032.png, frame 808x715). Two assertions on purpose -- the log says the button was pressed and scrollTo was CALLED, the picture says the VIEW MOVED; a scrollTo that silently did nothing and a click that missed both leave the list at Row 0. The wincap non-black count was IDENTICAL before and after (534280/577720), the third time that metric has been blind to a real change -- it answers is this a real capture, never did content change"
2026-09-09,windows,gtk4,P34,ok,ok,window,default,"#87 re-verification after the 2026-09-09 P34 edits: actions/win/P34-show-more-rows.csv still lands, log show plus 100 -> visibleRows=200 with -rows 500. The frame grew 808x669 -> 808x715 (reported by the replay itself as 808x715@104,104) because a ScrollViewReader block was added BELOW the buttons; the Still missing: Text was a one-line replacement, so nothing above the button row moved. Measured first (Show +100 at x 183..281 y 228..261, so 232,245 is inside) and then RUN, because the 2026-09-04 edit moved this same button 66px and the replay clicked empty space while reporting success"
