2026-09-09,-,-,P17,-,-,-,-,RESTALE per flow.md 3e-1: P17 itself changed on 2026-09-09 -- a press trail was added and P17Measured's readout moved back to an overlay. The 2026-09-08 rows about coordinates and the 260 pt offset describe the layout BEFORE that and stay true as history; the 2026-09-09 picker-and-sizes row was written after and is current
2026-09-09,-,-,P54,-,-,-,-,"RESTALE per flow.md 3e-1: P54's description text changed after the macOS and iOS runs (Android's affordance is a full-width row, not a corner button). Those rows stand -- their claim is the counter reaching 2, which wording does not touch, and the affordances are a floating overlay and a pull gesture, neither moved by a text edit. Checked rather than assumed"
2026-09-09,ios,uikit,P56,ok,ok,window,default,ScrollViewReader: P56-jump-to-row-59.csv moves the list from rows 0-15 to rows 45-52 and the status line reads 59 (VERIFIED p56-ios-final-20260909-102457.png). Did NOT hit the nesting trap .refreshable fell into -- scrollTo sets the inner scroll view's offset and has no gesture to lose to RootScrollHost
